{"version":1,"content":"<p>被譽為「最傳奇港姐」的74歲張瑪莉（Mary），日前特地遠赴澳洲前往當地墓園，拜祭已故前夫，李小龍胞兄李忠琛。</p><p>當天適逢李忠琛生忌，張瑪莉親自為墓碑清理雜草並獻上鮮花，更在社交平台深情寫下：「今天是您的生辰，我們都非常掛念您。</p><p>安息主懷，他日重</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:00.848116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.868676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.868676+00:00","content_hash":"38d365e706b50df7230df07ad779131641349ff1b3d1002aa41e25a73dc49a38","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}